  - m_Id: 75211322673381376
    m_Localized: From ages past, people have risen in times of peril
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75211322698547200
    m_Localized: 'When the nation faces ruin,

      those who stand in righteous
      anger'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75211322698547201
    m_Localized: is the foundation of a true nation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75211322698547202
    m_Localized: Upon reading this proclamation,  rally the people, form your ranks,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75211322698547203
    m_Localized: and save the people of this land from despair.
